# CQ25 [Actors & operations] Which maintenance activities were performed, by whom, on which failure and how long did they take?
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?maintenance ?actor ?failure ?component ?start ?duration ?unit WHERE {
  ?maintenance a optimar:Maintenance ; optimar:performedBy ?actor .
  OPTIONAL { ?maintenance optimar:addressesFailure ?failure . OPTIONAL { ?failure optimar:affects ?component } }
  OPTIONAL { ?maintenance optimar:startDateTime ?start }
  OPTIONAL { ?maintenance optimar:duration [ qudt:numericValue ?duration ; qudt:unit ?unit ] }
} ORDER BY ?start
